================================================================================
ATTRIBUTION AND ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS
================================================================================

This project, simdjson-zig, is an independent implementation in Zig inspired by
and based on the algorithms, architecture, and research of the original simdjson
and fast_float projects:

1. simdjson:
   - Primary Authors: Daniel Lemire and Geoff Langdale
   - Contributors: The simdjson authors and community (https://github.com/simdjson/simdjson)
   - Original License: Apache License, Version 2.0
   - Academic Publications:
     * Geoff Langdale, Daniel Lemire, "Parsing Gigabytes of JSON per Second",
       The VLDB Journal 29 (6), 2020, pages 1205–1215.
     * John Keiser, Daniel Lemire, "Validating UTF-8 In Less Than One Instruction Per Byte",
       Software: Practice and Experience 51 (4), 2021, pages 690–705.

2. fast_float:
   - Primary Author: Daniel Lemire
   - Contributors: The fast_float authors and community (https://github.com/fastfloat/fast_float)
   - Original License: Apache License, Version 2.0 / MIT License
   - Academic Publication:
     * Daniel Lemire, "Number Parsing at a Gigabyte per Second",
       Software: Practice and Experience 51 (8), 2021, pages 1705–1734.
